{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}}\f0\fs20 GameLingo Desktop - local evaluation build\par
GameLingo reads the image source you select and translates text locally. The optional TV listener operates on your local network. Models install separately. Open-source runtime components retain their original licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES and the licenses folder in the application directory.\par
Uninstalling the application preserves local models, profiles, pairing identity and translation memory in your Windows user profile.\par}
